        "text": "---"
      },
      {
        "line": 5,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 6,
        "text": "# UX Writing"
      },
      {
        "line": 7,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 8,
        "text": "Write clear, helpful copy that guides users through your interface."
      },
      {
        "line": 9,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 10,
        "text": "## Core Principles"
      },
      {
        "line": 11,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 12,
        "text": "### 1. Clarity Over Cleverness"
      },
      {
        "line": 13,
        "text": "- Use simple, familiar words"
      },
      {
        "line": 14,
        "text": "- Avoid jargon and technical terms"
      },
      {
        "line": 15,
        "text": "- Say what you mean directly"
      },
      {
        "line": 16,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 17,
        "text": "### 2. Be Concise"
      },
      {
        "line": 18,
        "text": "- Cut unnecessary words"
      },
      {
        "line": 19,
        "text": "- One idea per sentence"
      },
      {
        "line": 20,
        "text": "- Front-load important information"
      },
      {
        "line": 21,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 22,
        "text": "### 3. Be Helpful"
      },
      {
        "line": 23,
        "text": "- Tell users what to do, not just what happened"
      },
      {
        "line": 24,
        "text": "- Provide next steps"
      },
      {
        "line": 25,
        "text": "- Reduce anxiety and uncertainty"
      },
      {
        "line": 26,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 27,
        "text": "## Button Labels"
      },
      {
        "line": 28,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 29,
        "text": "### Do"
      },
      {
        "line": 30,
        "text": "- Use action verbs: \"Save,\" \"Send,\" \"Create\""
      },
      {
        "line": 31,
        "text": "- Be specific: \"Add to Cart\" not \"Submit\""
      },
      {
        "line": 32,
        "text": "- Match user intent: \"Sign up free\""
      },
      {
        "line": 33,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 34,
        "text": "### Don't"
      },
      {
        "line": 35,
        "text": "- Generic: \"OK,\" \"Submit,\" \"Continue\""
      },
      {
        "line": 36,
        "text": "- Vague: \"Click here,\" \"Go\""
      },
      {
        "line": 37,
        "text": "- Negative framing: \"Don't cancel\""
      },
      {
        "line": 38,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 39,
        "text": "### Examples"
      },
      {
        "line": 40,
        "text": "| Instead of | Use |"
      },
      {
        "line": 41,
        "text": "|------------|-----|"
      },
      {
        "line": 42,
        "text": "| Submit | Send Message |"
      },
      {
        "line": 43,
        "text": "| OK | Got it |"
      },
      {
        "line": 44,
        "text": "| Continue | Next: Payment |"
      },
      {
        "line": 45,
        "text": "| Cancel | Keep Editing |"
      },
      {
        "line": 46,
        "text": "| Yes/No | Delete / Keep |"
      },
      {
        "line": 47,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 48,
        "text": "## Error Messages"
      },
      {
        "line": 49,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 50,
        "text": "### Formula"
      },
      {
        "line": 51,
        "text": "What happened + Why + How to fix it"
      },
      {
        "line": 52,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 53,
        "text": "### Examples"
      },
      {
        "line": 54,
        "text": "\u274c \"Error 404\""
      },
      {
        "line": 55,
        "text": "\u2705 \"Page not found. Try searching or go back to the homepage.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 56,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 57,
        "text": "\u274c \"Invalid input\""
      },
      {
        "line": 58,
        "text": "\u2705 \"Please enter a valid email address (e.g., name@example.com)\""
      },
      {
        "line": 59,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 60,
        "text": "\u274c \"Something went wrong\""
      },
      {
        "line": 61,
        "text": "\u2705 \"We couldn't save your changes. Check your connection and try again.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 62,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 63,
        "text": "### Guidelines"
      },
      {
        "line": 64,
        "text": "- Be specific about the problem"
      },
      {
        "line": 65,
        "text": "- Avoid blame (\"You entered...\")"
      },
      {
        "line": 66,
        "text": "- Suggest a solution"
      },
      {
        "line": 67,
        "text": "- Use plain language, not error codes"
      },
      {
        "line": 68,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 69,
        "text": "## Empty States"
      },
      {
        "line": 70,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 71,
        "text": "### What to Include"
      },
      {
        "line": 72,
        "text": "1. What this space is for"
      },
      {
        "line": 73,
        "text": "2. Why it's empty"
      },
      {
        "line": 74,
        "text": "3. How to fill it"
      },
      {
        "line": 75,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 76,
        "text": "### Examples"
      },
      {
        "line": 77,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 78,
        "text": "**No search results**"
      },
      {
        "line": 79,
        "text": "\"No results for 'xyz'. Try different keywords or check your spelling.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 80,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 81,
        "text": "**Empty inbox**"
      },
      {
        "line": 82,
        "text": "\"No messages yet. When someone contacts you, you'll see it here.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 83,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 84,
        "text": "**First-time user**"
      },
      {
        "line": 85,
        "text": "\"Your projects will appear here. Create your first project to get started.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 86,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 87,
        "text": "## Loading & Progress"
      },
      {
        "line": 88,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 89,
        "text": "### Short waits (< 2 seconds)"
      },
      {
        "line": 90,
        "text": "Just show a spinner, no text needed"
      },
      {
        "line": 91,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 92,
        "text": "### Medium waits (2-10 seconds)"
      },
      {
        "line": 93,
        "text": "\"Loading your dashboard...\""
      },
      {
        "line": 94,
        "text": "\"Saving changes...\""
      },
      {
        "line": 95,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 96,
        "text": "### Long waits (> 10 seconds)"
      },
      {
        "line": 97,
        "text": "\"Processing your video. This usually takes 1-2 minutes.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 98,
        "text": "Show progress percentage when possible"
      },
      {
        "line": 99,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 100,
        "text": "## Success Messages"
      },
      {
        "line": 101,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 102,
        "text": "### Be Specific"
      },
      {
        "line": 103,
        "text": "\u274c \"Success!\""
      },
      {
        "line": 104,
        "text": "\u2705 \"Your profile has been updated.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 105,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 106,
        "text": "### Confirm the Action"
      },
      {
        "line": 107,
        "text": "\"Message sent to sarah@example.com\""
      },
      {
        "line": 108,
        "text": "\"Order #12345 confirmed. Shipping in 2-3 days.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 109,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 110,
        "text": "### Suggest Next Steps"
      },
      {
        "line": 111,
        "text": "\"Password changed. You can now sign in with your new password.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 112,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 113,
        "text": "## Tooltips & Hints"
      },
      {
        "line": 114,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 115,
        "text": "### When to Use"
      },
      {
        "line": 116,
        "text": "- Explain unfamiliar UI elements"
      },
      {
        "line": 117,
        "text": "- Provide context for actions"
      },
      {
        "line": 118,
        "text": "- Show keyboard shortcuts"
      },
      {
        "line": 119,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 120,
        "text": "### Keep Them Short"
      },
      {
        "line": 121,
        "text": "- Under 150 characters"
      },
      {
        "line": 122,
        "text": "- One concept per tooltip"
      },
      {
        "line": 123,
        "text": "- No critical information (tooltips are hidden by default)"
      },
      {
        "line": 124,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 125,
        "text": "## Onboarding Copy"
      },
      {
        "line": 126,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 127,
        "text": "### Welcome Messages"
      },
      {
        "line": 128,
        "text": "- Acknowledge the milestone"
      },
      {
        "line": 129,
        "text": "- Set expectations"
      },
      {
        "line": 130,
        "text": "- Point to first action"
      },
      {
        "line": 131,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 132,
        "text": "**Example:**"
      },
      {
        "line": 133,
        "text": "\"Welcome to Acme! Let's set up your workspace in 3 quick steps.\""
      },
      {
        "line": 134,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 135,
        "text": "### Progressive Disclosure"
      },
      {
        "line": 136,
        "text": "- Don't explain everything at once"
      },
      {
        "line": 137,
        "text": "- Introduce features when relevant"
      },
      {
        "line": 138,
        "text": "- Use inline hints over tutorials"
      },
      {
        "line": 139,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 140,
        "text": "## Voice & Tone Guidelines"
      },
      {
        "line": 141,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 142,
        "text": "### Voice (Consistent)"
      },
      {
        "line": 143,
        "text": "- Friendly but professional"
      },
      {
        "line": 144,
        "text": "- Clear and direct"
      },
      {
        "line": 145,
        "text": "- Helpful and supportive"
      },
      {
        "line": 146,
        "text": ""
      },
      {
        "line": 147,
        "text": "### Tone (Varies by Context)"
      },
      {
        "line": 148,
        "text": "| Situation | Tone |"
      },
      {
        "line": 149,
        "text": "|-----------|------|"
      },
      {
        "line": 150,
        "text": "| Success | Celebratory, warm |"
      },
      {
        "line": 151,
        "text": "| Error | Calm, helpful |"
      },
      {
        "line": 152,
        "text": "| Warning | Serious, clear |"
      },
      {
        "line": 153,
        "text": "| Onboarding | Encouraging, patient |"
      },
      {
        "line": 154,
        "text": "| Settings | Neutral, informative |"
      }
